{"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Cloud-File-System","title":"Cloud File System","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem","doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveAuthenticator"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A Google Drive cloud backend for Ensembles."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"EnsemblesGoogleDrive provides ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", an implementation of the Ensembles "},{"code":"CloudFileSystem","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol that stores sync data on Google Drive. It communicates directly with the Google Drive REST API v3 using "},{"code":"URLSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — no third-party SDK required.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Google Drive uses file IDs rather than paths internally. The backend transparently bridges between Ensembles’ path-based ","type":"text"},{"code":"CloudFileSystem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol and Google Drive’s ID-based system, caching folder and file IDs to minimize API calls.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Authentication","text":"Authentication","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The included ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/documentation\/EnsemblesGoogleDrive\/GoogleDriveAuthenticator","type":"reference"},{"text":" handles the full OAuth 2.0 authorization code flow, stores tokens in the Keychain, and automatically refreshes expired tokens.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Google Cloud Console setup:"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Go to "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/console.cloud.google.com\/"},{"type":"text","text":" and create a project (or select an existing one)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enable the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Google Drive API","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" under "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"APIs & Services → Library","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Go to ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"APIs & Services → Credentials"}]},{"text":" and create an ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OAuth 2.0 Client ID"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Select ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS"}]},{"text":" as the application type and enter your app’s bundle identifier.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note the "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Client ID","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (looks like "},{"code":"123456789-abc.apps.googleusercontent.com","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set the redirect URI to: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.googleusercontent.apps.YOUR-CLIENT-ID:\/oauthredirect"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Code:","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import EnsemblesGoogleDrive","","let config = GoogleDriveAuthenticator.Configuration(","    clientID: \"YOUR-CLIENT-ID.apps.googleusercontent.com\",","    redirectURI: \"com.googleusercontent.apps.YOUR-CLIENT-ID:\/oauthredirect\"",")","let authenticator = GoogleDriveAuthenticator(configuration: config)","","\/\/ One-time interactive authorization (presents a web sign-in sheet)","try await authenticator.authorize(presenting: window)","","\/\/ Create the cloud file system","let cloudFS = GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem(authenticator: authenticator)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"On subsequent launches, the authenticator restores tokens from the Keychain and refreshes them automatically. Call ","type":"text"},{"code":"authenticator.isAuthorized","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to check if stored credentials exist.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For apps that manage tokens externally, pass a static access token instead:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let cloudFS = GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem(accessToken: \"your-token\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Setup","anchor":"Setup"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Ensembles","import EnsemblesGoogleDrive","","let cloudFS = GoogleDriveCloudFileSystem(authenticator: authenticator)","let ensemble = CoreDataEnsemble(","    ensembleIdentifier: \"MainStore\",","    persistentStoreURL: storeURL,","    managedObjectModelURL: modelURL,","    cloudFileSystem: cloudFS",")","try await ensemble?.attachPersistentStore()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"API Details","anchor":"API-Details"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The backend uses the Google Drive REST API v3 with the "},{"code":"drive.file","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" scope, which limits access to files the app creates. Ensembles paths are resolved to Google Drive file IDs via folder traversal, with re